    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WESTERN\nAIR LINES\nJAN. 1, 1944\nWILBUR\nWRIGHT\nORVILLE\nWRIGHT\nForty years ago, on December 17,\n1903, Orville and Wilbur Wright made\nthe world's first successful \"heavier-\nthan-air\" fight at Kitty Hawk, North\nCarolina. This towering marble memo-\nrial stands on the spot today, immortal-\nizing aviation's most important event."
